  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "Only R08 holds, making Linkage the sole adverse family. Four accounts share the shipping address; although it is the customer's home, its recent registration prevents the household exception. No earlier outcome settles the order. Row §6.6(b) initially required id_check, and that check passed. Under §5.3(a), every required check has passed, so clear is mandatory and further friction is prohibited. A legitimate household member opening an account is the strongest benign explanation. No installments were due, so repayment intent cannot support an adverse recommendation. No further check is needed."
